.\nShared ownership opportunities and a better working environment for veterinary specialists and emergency doctors.\nLearn More About Arista\nAbout Us\nWhat We Do\nCareers\nHome\nLocations\nFind My Arista\nAtlanta\nDallas\nJacksonville\nPet Owners\nEmergency\nSpecialty Referral & Care Navigation\nPayments\nFAQ\nVeterinarians\nMake a Referral\nAbout Care Navigation\nVeterinarian Openings\nAbout Us\nWhat Is Arista?\nOur Leadership\nNews\nBlogs\nContact Us\nCareers\nCompany Overview\nOwnership Opportunities for Veterinarians\nVeterinarians\nCare Navigation & Management\nTechnicians & Assistants\nVeterinarian Openings\nNon-Veterinarian Openings\nMake a Referral\nEmergency\nBelieve In A Better Way\n© 2026 Arista\nInformation on this website is proprietary and confidential.\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google\nPrivacy Policy\nand\nTerms of Service\napply.\nBack to Top ^",
